      "body": "I've written to lawyer. Will report back when I hear back.\nK\n\nOn Thu, Dec 16, 2021 at 7:50 AM Brad Hubbard-Nelson <\n***@***.***> wrote:\n\n> This is the first version:\n> [image: Screen Shot 2021-12-16 at 7 39 54 AM]\n> <https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/12800484/146374011-0c9295fe-f6ea-4634-86b3-d942dbc36658.png>\n>\n> Changes requested:\n>\n>    1. Once closed, the banner needs to go away and not be shown again.\n>    This could be done with a cookie or with localStorage. Potentially also the\n>    back end could record that it was seen and dismissed (for regulatory\n>    compliance);\n>    2. The text should be changed ***@***.*** <https://github.com/kaatvds>\n>    please give feedback]; This website uses cookies to provide the best user\n>    experience we can. We share no data with third parties or for any\n>    commercial purpose. By using this site, you accept this use of cookies as\n>    outlined in our data privacy policy.\n>    3. The button that says \"Cookie Policy\" should say \"Data Privacy\n>    Policy\"\n>\n> —\n> You are receiving this because you were mentioned.\n> Reply to this email directly, view it on GitHub\n> <https://github.com/massenergize/frontend-portal/issues/682#issuecomment-995786888>,\n> or unsubscribe\n> <https://github.com/notifications/unsubscribe-auth/AHHAB3BP6HLG2OPSI6QZGT3URHOA3ANCNFSM5EORLTFA>\n> .\n> Triage notifications on the go with GitHub Mobile for iOS\n> <https://apps.apple.com/app/apple-store/id1477376905?ct=notification-email&mt=8&pt=524675>\n> or Android\n> <https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.github.android&referrer=utm_campaign%3Dnotification-email%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dgithub>.\n>\n>\n\n\n-- \n-- \nKaat Vander Straeten\n(Pronouns: she, her, hers)\nPh.D. Philosophy, MA Communication Sciences\n\n\"Look, Ma, no hands!\"    |   “Ring the bells that still can ring / Forget\nyour perfect offering / There is a crack / A crack in everything / That’s\nhow the light gets